MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- response_surface: 2–4 explanatory variates (pp. 470–472 "can be
  extended to three or more"): monomials by degree, generalized
  marginality, pure error over all variate combinations, surface grid in
  x1, x2 with the other variates at their means.
- trigonometric_regression: estimate_period — profile RSS over
  [ω₀/2, 2ω₀] and bounded refinement (the model is non-linear in ω,
  p. 462); SEs and df from the Jacobian of the full model, period with
  CI and F test against the fixed period.
- Tests against statsmodels OLS type I sums of squares and scipy
  curve_fit (period SE), parameter recovery on simulated data.

